      "extract": "arXiv:math/9806163v1 [math.CO] 30 Jun 1998 Weights of Markov Traces on Hecke Algebras∗ R.C. Orellana November 16, 2021 Abstract We compute the weights, i.e. the values at the minimal idempotents, for the Markov trace on the Hecke algebra of type Bn and type Dn. In order to prove the weight formula, we deﬁne representations of the Hecke algebra of type B onto a reduced Hecke Algebra of type A. To compute the weights",
